      "value": "<p><strong>Area Attack.</strong> Each creature in a 3 squares line the wolf moves through rolls <strong>Evasion</strong> vs DC 11. Hit: <code>1d6</code> thermal (cinder) + violence; half on success. Wolf can move up to its speed in a straight line as part of this action; it doesn't provoke reaction strikes from the line.<br/><em>Recharges on a Soma Break.</em></p><p><em>It runs along the burn and lets the burn run along it.</em></p>",
